frame "Ought implies can (Kant; cited from memory) is the deontic axiom D, O p -> P p" reading "D holds on a frame exactly when it is serial, checked on all relations up to 3 worlds in beauvoir.py; that morality is this logic is a reading" -> 4 label checked-finite reach 3 cost 40
