record culture/social social checked-finite "culture/social/humanities.ath: 3 voters on 3 options, 12 of 216 profiles cycle (1/18); every labelled graph on up to 5 vertices and every labelling: strong triadic closure makes a local bridge weak when an endpoint has two strong edges (the bare form fails at one edge); ought-implies-can as axiom D is serial (beauvoir.py); chains map onto the 2-chain; paired Propp tales counted. Readings are analogy."
